      Chevrons in the middle color (solid or gradient) on the bottom part color, which can be transparent.
      The track is masked to the chevron shape and moves one chevron width per loop. The fill inside it moves back by the
      same amount, so the gradient stays in place while the chevrons march through it. The outer layer fades the edges.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div id="{{ id }}-svg" class="divider-box divider-box--chevrons" style="--divider-middle-background: {{ middle_part_color }}">
      <div class="divider-chevrons-fade"><div class="divider-chevrons-track"><div class="divider-chevrons-fill"></div></div></div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
